 :root-cause
 "The singleton shortcut required a truthy intermediate stream, so nil fell into the wide branch. An empty resource-side arrow therefore calculated direct-grant relations and could open subject-side scans even though its authorization result was necessarily false."
 :fix
 "Return false before singleton/wide selection when the resource-side stream is empty. Model the exact empty/singleton/wide source control in Dafny, prove zero or one intermediate skips direct intersection and the optimized result equals complete far-side evaluation, and compare generated Java/JavaScript Boolean and work traces with actual CLJ/CLJS execution."
